Z||000016||WKDFIRO||11-23-2001||04:37 PM||||Here in So Cal, Im already starting to hear the parts guy saying the dreaded words, "special order" or even worse, "Dealer only" for my 85 GT. I know if I have to go to the dealer I have almost lost the fight already...<P>But I really feel for the 88 owners. They are probably already paying through the nose even from the salvage yards for their parts, ESPECIALLY the suspension pieces!<P>It almost sounds like a break if what JohnF says is true about GM releasing the jigs etc for "classics."<P>Yeah, GM give us Fiero owners a break. <P>I wish it didn't sound like a joke...||||reg||9
